flowchart TD
    Pick["<b>1. choose one packet</b><br/>fix a concrete 5-tuple and direction<br/><b>handoff:</b> every probe needs the same packet identity<br/><b>state:</b> expected src, dst, proto, ports"]

    Entry["<b>2. RX entry</b><br/>driver, optional XDP, skb creation, GRO, RX core dispatch<br/><b>handoff:</b> accepted skb reaches the IP handler<br/><b>state:</b> skb has protocol metadata and possible GRO aggregate"]

    Policy["<b>3. ingress policy</b><br/>tc ingress, PREROUTING, conntrack, DNAT, filters<br/><b>handoff:</b> route lookup must see any rewrites<br/><b>state:</b> nfct may be attached, dst may be changed"]

    Route["<b>4. route decision</b><br/>FIB rules and tables choose local delivery or forwarding<br/><b>handoff:</b> dst input/output selects the next subsystem<br/><b>state:</b> skb_dst points at the chosen route"]

    Local["<b>5a. local receive</b><br/>LOCAL_IN and TCP/UDP socket lookup deliver payload<br/><b>state:</b> data is queued for application read"]

    Forward["<b>5b. forwarding</b><br/>FORWARD, POST_ROUTING, qdisc, driver TX<br/><b>state:</b> packet leaves through the selected egress device"]

    Pick --> Entry --> Policy --> Route
    Route --> Local
    Route --> Forward

    classDef observe fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px
    classDef hook fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px
    classDef state fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class Pick,Entry observe
    class Policy,Forward hook
    class Route,Local state
